# Creates a new API key for the authenticated Tenant's own account. Requires
# a Tenant access token (from /tenants/login), never an API key itself.

### Happy path (replace with a real access_token from tenancy.login.rest)
POST http://localhost:8080/tenants/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_REAL_ACCESS_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### No credential — expect 401
POST http://localhost:8080/tenants/api-keys
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### An API key presented instead of an access token — expect 403
POST http://localhost:8080/tenants/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer lp_some_api_key_value
Content-Type: application/json

{}
